{"full":"hf:vml12/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora","spaceId":"vml12/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora","name":"MiniMax H3 Turbo LoRA - I2V with Audio","source":"huggingface","description":"Fast video & audio generation with 4-step Turbo LoRA","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","video-generation","image-to-video","minimax-h3-turbo","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":6,"created":"2026-09-20T17:11:38.000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T09:56:26.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://vml12-minimax-h3-turbo-lora.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/vml12/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:44.147Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:44.147Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:44.147Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎤","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Joint high-fidelity video and synchronized audio generation using unquantized bfloat16 weights with a 4-step Turbo LoRA.","Distributed ZeroGPU Architecture: MiniMax-H3 (196 GiB bf16) exceeds Hugging Face's 150 GB per-Space disk limit. To avoid quality-degrading NVFP4/FP8 quantization, the pipeline is split across two coordinated Spaces: - Conditioner Space: qwen3vl-conditioner (Text/Vision encoding, 62 GiB bf16) - Denoising Space (This Space): Transformer & VAEs (72 GiB bf16)"],"features":["⚡ 4-Step Turbo LoRA: Default 6 sampling steps (down from 28) using larryvrh/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora folded directly into weights at startup.","🚀 AoTI Compilation: 50 transformer blocks accelerated via PyTorch AoTI (multimodalart/minimax-h3-aoti), saving 0.5s/step overhead.","🎯 Full Precision (bf16): Zero quantization artifacts; outputs full 24 fps video with matching stereo AAC soundtrack.","💻 Custom Studio Interface: Built on Gradio Server & FastAPI with server-side keyframe crop/canvas fitting."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/vml12/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c56